  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Support to Artisan Miners (JSDF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main Development Objective is to significantly reduce the poverty levels of sixteen artisan and small-scale mining (ASM) communities in rural Ethiopia through the provision of training and small credit facilities, promoting social, economic and environmental sustainability</narrative>
